          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of two stationary bright points in the sky followed by rapid movement: very likely observation of two aircraft during military maneuvers.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "e2458ac21de16cffc908bcac3df391867c0b5b5562974f62444eb9dbc2830676"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
